{"title":"Dough","sourceTitle":"Dough/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Dough\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Dough (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Dough/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Pâte (23% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Dough/pl\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Ciasto (23% translated)\" lang=\"pl\" dir=\"ltr\">polski</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Dough/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Тесто (23% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Dough/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"面团 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<p><b>Massa</b> é um ingrediente culinário feito de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Flour\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Flour\">farinha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Flour\" title=\"Flour\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Water\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Water\">água</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Water\" title=\"Water\"> </a></span>. É usada para criar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bread\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bread\">pão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bread\" title=\"Bread\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/pie\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/pie\">torta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pie\" title=\"Pie\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><br />\n<span id=\"Creation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<p>Massa é criada combinando uma unidade de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Flour\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Flour\">farinha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Flour\" title=\"Flour\"> </a></span> com 1L de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Water\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Water\">água</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Water\" title=\"Water\"> </a></span> na grade de inventário. Todos os tipos de grão podem ser transformados em massa.\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Dough-flax.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Linho\"><img alt=\"Linho\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/23/Dough-flax.png/120px-Dough-flax.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/23/Dough-flax.png/180px-Dough-flax.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/23/Dough-flax.png/240px-Dough-flax.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Grain\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Grain\">Linho</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Grain\" title=\"Grain\"> </a></span></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Dough-rye.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Centeio\"><img alt=\"Centeio\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/75/Dough-rye.png/120px-Dough-rye.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/75/Dough-rye.png/180px-Dough-rye.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/75/Dough-rye.png/240px-Dough-rye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">  <a href=\"