tle=\"Arroz\"><img alt=\"Arroz\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/06/Dough-rice.png/120px-Dough-rice.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/06/Dough-rice.png/180px-Dough-rice.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/06/Dough-rice.png/240px-Dough-rice.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">  <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Grain\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Grain\">Arroz</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Grain\" title=\"Grain\"> </a></span></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Dough-cassava.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Mandioca\"><img alt=\"Mandioca\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/39/Dough-cassava.png/120px-Dough-cassava.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/39/Dough-cassava.png/180px-Dough-cassava.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/39/Dough-cassava.png/240px-Dough-cassava.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">  <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Grain\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Grain\">Mandioca</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Grain\" title=\"Grain\"> </a></span></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Dough-sunflower.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Girassol\"><img alt=\"Girassol\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/4e/Dough-sunflower.png/120px-Dough-sunflower.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4e/Dough-sunflower.png/180px-Dough-sunflower.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/4e/Dough-sunflower.png/240px-Dough-sunflower.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">  <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Grain\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Grain\">Girassol</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Grain\" title=\"Grain\"> </a></span></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br />\n<span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Massa pode ser assada diretamente em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bread\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bread\">pão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bread\" title=\"Bread\"> </a></span> ou usada para criar uma <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/pie\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/pie\">torta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pie\" title=\"Pie\"> </a></span>. Para transformar massa em pão, basta colocá-la em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/clay_oven\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/clay oven\">forno de argila</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clay_oven\" title=\"Clay oven\"> </a></span> aquecido. Para transformar massa em crosta de torta, coloque-a em uma <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Wooden_table\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Wooden table\">mesa de madeira</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Wooden_table\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wooden table\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Comida e Culinária</span><